	(text "EC11: A/B quadrature to PIO (CLK/DT), switch to a GPIO. 10k pull-ups to +3V3\n(the RP2350 internal ~50k are enabled too); 10 nF debounce footprints on A/B -\nbuy, leave unpopulated (the PIO decoder does not need them)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.87 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c3f6d18a-593f-441e-90ba-33de6595a495")
	)
	(text "OLED: I2C1 at 1 MHz, u8g2 SH1106 driver, address 0x3C.\nPin order measured on the part in hand: 1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 SCK, 4 SDA,\nnumbered from the display side with pin 1 on the left. The usual\nGND-VCC-SCL-SDA order would have put 3V3 on the module's ground pin.\nHeader is centred on the module; the four M2 holes are still assumed.\nModules carry their own SDA/SCL pull-ups (~4k7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6204789c-63a1-49af-8416-f19fa205d81d")
	)
	(text "H1-H4: M2, 30 x 28 mm hole to hole (display module, measured - panel_10hp.svg)"
